        rdfs:comment                   "Picture panel of embroidered cream silk in polychrome silks in long, short, split, satin and stem stitches with French knots. With the figures of Saint Joseph and the young Christ walking in a meadow by a stream. In the background is a palm tree and a house.\n\nThe embroidered panel is bordered by an applied braid of silk and silver threads."@en , "Picture panel of embroidered silk in silks, Italy, 1700-1750."@en ;
